# Every text file is stored and checked out with LF line endings, on every
# platform. The format gates (gofmt, prettier) and CI expect LF; without this a
# Git for Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true by default) turns the whole
# working tree CRLF and the pre-commit hook reports every file as unformatted.
* text=auto eol=lf

